{
  "_comment": [
    "FASE 3B - NOTEBOOK 1: Original -> Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 GGUF.",
    "Derivado de qwen_edit_multiref/v1. NAO substitui aquele workflow.",
    "NAO e o Flow 02 e NAO produz Chibi Master.",
    "",
    "UNICA diferenca em relacao ao multiref: o node 1 e UnetLoaderGGUF, do",
    "custom node ComfyUI-GGUF (city96). O UNETLoader core NAO le .gguf, e as",
    "quantizacoes Q3_K_M/Q4_0 so existem em GGUF de terceiro. UnetLoaderGGUF",
    "nao tem o campo weight_dtype: a precisao ja esta no arquivo.",
    "",
    "O text encoder continua no CLIPLoader core (safetensors fp8_scaled).",
    "NAO trocar por CLIPLoaderGGUF: misturar fp8 scaled com loader GGUF da",
    "'Mixing scaled FP8 with GGUF is not supported'. So se usaria o loader",
    "GGUF com um text encoder GGUF + o mmproj correspondente, que nao e o",
    "que este experimento baixa.",
    "",
    "Papel de cada slot (identico ao multiref):",
    "  image1 = imagem principal a ser editada (aqui: o full_body ORIGINAL).",
    "  image2/image3 = referencias de design, so condicionamento.",
    "",
    "[TEST REQUIRED] Validar com /object_info antes da primeira execucao."
  ],
  "1": {
    "class_type": "UnetLoaderGGUF",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 GGUF (ComfyUI-GGUF / city96)"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "unet_name": "%%UNET_NAME%%"
    }
  },
  "2": {
    "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Text encoder (Qwen2.5-VL)"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "clip_name": "%%CLIP_NAME%%",
      "type": "qwen_image",
      "device": "default"
    }
  },
  "3": {
    "class_type": "VAELoader",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "VAE"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "vae_name": "%%VAE_NAME%%"
    }
  },
  "4": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Imagem principal a editar (saida do FLUX ou original)"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "image": "%%INPUT_IMAGE%%",
      "upload": "image"
    }
  },
  "5": {
    "class_type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Prompt positivo + referencia"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "prompt": "%%PROMPT%%",
      "clip": [
        "2",
        0
      ],
      "vae": [
        "3",
        0
      ],
      "image1": [
        "4",
        0
      ],
      "image2": [
        "11",
        0
      ],
      "image3": [
        "12",
        0
      ]
    }
  },
  "6": {
    "class_type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Prompt negativo"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "prompt": "%%NEGATIVE_PROMPT%%",
      "clip": [
        "2",
        0
      ],
      "vae": [
        "3",
        0
      ]
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "class_type": "KSampler",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Sampler (denoise < 1.0 preserva a base)"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "seed": "%%SEED%%",
      "steps": "%%STEPS%%",
      "cfg": "%%CFG%%",
      "sampler_name": "%%SAMPLER%%",
      "scheduler": "%%SCHEDULER%%",
      "denoise": "%%DENOISE%%",
      "model": [
        "1",
        0
      ],
      "positive": [
        "5",
        0
      ],
      "negative": [
        "6",
        0
      ],
      "latent_image": [
        "13",
        0
      ]
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "class_type": "VAEDecode",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Decode"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "samples": [
        "8",
        0
      ],
      "vae": [
        "3",
        0
      ]
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "class_type": "SaveImage",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Output"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "images": [
        "9",
        0
      ],
      "filename_prefix": "%%OUTPUT_PREFIX%%"
    }
  },
  "11": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Referencia de design 2"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "image": "%%INPUT_IMAGE_2%%",
      "upload": "image"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Referencia de design 3"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "image": "%%INPUT_IMAGE_3%%",
      "upload": "image"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "class_type": "VAEEncode",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Latente inicial <- imagem principal"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "pixels": [
        "4",
        0
      ],
      "vae": [
        "3",
        0
      ]
    }
  }
}
